<mxCell id="t3" value="&lt;b&gt;3 - NIN (UIN) generation E2E test TC_NIN_001 - white-box sequence (MOSIP 1.2.x LTS)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Test executor &lt;b&gt;Jarvis&lt;/b&gt; opens the ROOT span (trace_id T, span_id S0). Context propagates through HTTP (W3C traceparent + baggage), Kafka / ActiveMQ headers; WebSub callbacks start a new trace linked by span link. Every MOSIP span carries &lt;b&gt;mosip.rid&lt;/b&gt;. API paths follow MOSIP 1.2.x public OpenAPI specs - verify against your deployed version.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="5" width="2700" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
