<mxCell id="leg6" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; &lt;font color=&quot;#1f4e79&quot;&gt;&amp;#9472;&amp;#9654; signal or query (OTLP / HTTPS)&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;&amp;#9472;&amp;#9654; audit path (separate tenant, read-only DB access)&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; - - &amp;gt; response &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;&amp;#8635; internal step&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;: evidence is read only through service accounts; the same queries are stored in the manifest so any verdict can be replayed; Grafana links use the same trace_id, window, environment and site as the oracle." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="10" y="1271" width="2250" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
